# Workbench — {{WORKBENCH_NAME}}

osEngineer-initialised workbench. This file is the workbench-level architect
manifest; it lists which repos belong to which Sovereign Shield category and
references the Codified Source of Truth (META) repo.

## Repos

The frontmatter `repos:` list above is the machine-parseable inventory. For each
repo, see `./<repo>/AGENTS.md` for the per-repo team manifest.

## Cross-repo coordination

Cross-repo handoffs live under `.osengineer/handoffs/XR-<n>-<slug>.md`. The
workbench architect inspects them on every prompt and routes to the target
repo's architect.

## META repo

The META (Codified Source of Truth) repo holds ADRs, plans, team archetypes,
Confluence sync artifacts, and the graphify-out knowledge graph that spans
the workbench. Run `osengineer explain teams` for the model overview.
